SUMMARY:Free Cuddle in the Park
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Cuddle Collective\nFree Cuddle in the Park (+ cuddle
  during the Montfort players show at 7:30)\n\nplease RSVP through this lin
 k so we know how many people to expect and can email you any changes or up
 dates https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/free-cuddle-in-the-park\n\nIsh
 ka is back in town and opening the late summer cuddle season with a Free c
 uddle event in the park. This is a gentle\, guided space to experience pla
 tonic\, non-sexual touch in nature. We center consent\, communication\, an
 d clear boundaries\n\nDuring the welcome circle\, we will review safety ag
 reements\, practice asking for what we want and saying “no”.\n\nWhat t
 o bring- Please bring a blanket and pillow to help create the cuddle space
 . Bring your own water & snacks to share.\n\nYou are welcome to bring frie
 nds. Children are welcome at this event!\n\nReminder - Touch is always opt
 ional at these events. Come as you are\, wear comfy clothes\, and let your
  nervous system breathe in the fresh air.\n\nfinding us- Park in the upper
  parking lot next to the community center and then look down the hill away
  from the road. You will see fruit trees and a couple of blankets starting
  to form the cuddle area. We will try to find a flat-ish space on the hill
 .\n\nAt 7:30 in the amphitheater below the montford players will be perfor
 ming The League of The Secret Pimpernel. I welcome the cuddle Collective t
 o wander down the hill together and continue cuddling while watching the s
 how.\n\n[https://montfordparkplayers.org/2026-season/](https://montfordpar
 kplayers.org/2026-season/) The shows are always free and its great to dona
 te to our local community theater!!!\n\nIf there is heavy RAIN - We will c
 ancel and potentially postpone this event.
